src/phonmatchnet.zig implements the PhonMatchNet architecture (Yong-Hyeok Lee
and Namhyun Cho, Interspeech 2023) after NCSOFT's BSD-3-Clause PyTorch
implementation, https://github.com/ncsoft/PhonMatchNet.
NCSOFT's copyright notice and license: licenses/PhonMatchNet-BSD-3-Clause.txt.
naptrapz is not affiliated with or endorsed by NCSOFT or the PhonMatchNet
authors.

src/text.zig reimplements the decoder-state "embedding" computation of g2p_en
by Kyubyong Park and Jongseok Kim (Apache-2.0), https://github.com/Kyubyong/g2p.

src/google.zig reimplements Google's speech_embedding/1 model (Apache-2.0).
naptrapz is not affiliated with or endorsed by Google.

src/unicode_data.zig is generated from the Unicode Character Database 15.0.0
by tools/generate_unicode.py. Unicode data is used under the Unicode License
V3: licenses/Unicode-License-v3.txt.

